{"id":"7954d66ef8c1e7be","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-minimal-program-indices.md","title":"部分函数的最小程序索引","display":"df-minimal-program-indices — 部分函数的最小程序索引","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-minimal-program-indices","aliases":["20-df-minimal-program-indices"],"display":"df-minimal-program-indices — 部分函数的最小程序索引","chapter":"2","section":"2.2","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Exercise 2.2.9(i)","source_printed_pages":[32],"source_pdf_pages":[68],"depends_on":["[[20-df-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-minimal-program-indices"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-minimal-program-indices</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-minimal-program-indices — 部分函数的最小程序索引"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 2.2.9(i)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>32</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\omega\">\\(e\\in\\omega\\)</span>；程序编号为固定的标准编号。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}program\\text{-}indices}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MIN}:=\\{e:\\forall j&lt;e\\ \\varphi_j\\ne\\varphi_e\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}program\\text{-}indices}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MIN}:=\\{e:\\forall j&lt;e\\ \\varphi_j\\ne\\varphi_e\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>最小性针对此编号中的函数外延类；改变编号可能改变 MIN 这个集合。每个部分可计算函数的非空索引集按自然数良序有唯一最小索引。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 2.2.9(i)；印刷页 32；PDF 第 68 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"e\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}program\\text{-}indices}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MIN}:=\\{e:\\forall j<e\\ \\varphi_j\\ne\\varphi_e\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1107,"backlinks":[{"id":"3ae45a11fe4b99fd","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-minimal-program-indices]]；see [[20-df-immune]]；see [[20-thm-recursion]]。"}],"outgoing":["dc642dd12c05d028"]}